{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42773","headline":"宴游池馆 · 刘兼","name":"宴游池馆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绮筵金碧照芳菲，酒满瑶巵水满池。\n去岁南岐离郡日，今春东蜀看花时。\n俭莲发脸当筹着，绪柳生腰按柘枝。\n座客半酣言笑狎，孔融怀抱正怡怡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42773.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42773","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}